\f0\fs24 \cf0 ==============================================\
Warrensburg Clothing Store\
==============================================\
\
A full-stack web project using:\
- React (Frontend)\
- Spring Boot (Backend)\
- H2 Database (SQL in file mode)\
- RESTful Microservices\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55358 \u56809  Structure\
----------------------------------------------\
online-clothing-store/\
\uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  clothing-ui/          (React frontend)\
\uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  customer-service/     (Spring Boot backend for users)\
\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  product-service/      (Spring Boot backend for products & cart)\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u9881 \u65039  Requirements\
----------------------------------------------\
- Java 21+\
- Maven 3.9+\
- Node.js 18+\
- npm\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55357 \u56960  How to Run\
----------------------------------------------\
1\uc0\u65039 \u8419  Open three terminal windows.\
\
\uc0\u55358 \u56991  Terminal 1 \'96 Customer Service:\
cd customer-service\
mvn spring-boot:run\
\
\uc0\u55358 \u56991  Terminal 2 \'96 Product Service:\
cd product-service\
mvn spring-boot:run\
\
\uc0\u55358 \u56991  Terminal 3 \'96 React Frontend:\
cd clothing-ui\
npm install\
npm start\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55357 \u56593  Login Information\
----------------------------------------------\
Admin Login:\
  Email: admin@wcs.com\
  Password: admin123\
\
Customer Login:\
  Use ANY email and password (auto-registers a new customer)\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55357 \u56771 \u65039  H2 Database Consoles\
----------------------------------------------\
Customers DB:\
  URL: http://localhost:8082/h2-console\
  JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:file:/Users/<YOUR_USERNAME>/customerdb\
  User: sa\
  Password: (blank)\
\
Products & Cart DB:\
  URL: http://localhost:8081/h2-console\
  JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:file:/Users/<YOUR_USERNAME>/productdb\
  User: sa\
  Password: (blank)\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55357 \u56522  Useful SQL Commands\
----------------------------------------------\
-- Customer Service (8082)\
SELECT ID, NAME, EMAIL, ROLE FROM CUSTOMER ORDER BY ID DESC;\
\
-- Product Service (8081)\
SELECT ID, NAME, PRICE, STOCK FROM PRODUCT ORDER BY ID;\
SELECT * FROM CART_ITEM;\
SELECT * FROM CART;\
\
----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55358 \u56830  Notes\
----------------------------------------------\
- H2 stores data on disk so your data persists between restarts.\
- If H2 breaks, delete customerdb.mv.db or productdb.mv.db and rerun.\
- Frontend will auto-refresh as you change backend data.\
}